{"content_hash": "dc0059ddfacfda99", "version_id": 964, "article_id": 97, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "OnePlus Ace 7 Pro adds periscope zoom to its gaming power", "title_zh": "一加 Ace 7 Pro 发布：游戏性能拉满，还补上了潜望长焦", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "mydrivers_ev", "source_url": "https://news.mydrivers.com/1/1165/1165652.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567019001814-57350903e2af?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8YWNlJTIwcHJvfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQ2MjAwMTB8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Jason Abrams on Unsplash", "author": "Jason Abrams", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@jabrams5?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-green-golf-ball-sitting-on-top-of-a-green-field-EN3AVjMPZWA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(124, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(162, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "8fec7547c198"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-14", "word_count": 243, "reading_minutes": 1.2, "lead": "OnePlus has launched the Ace 7 Pro, a phone that keeps the gaming focus of the Ace series but finally fixes its weak camera. A full flagship chip and a 3.5x periscope lens are the headline upgrades.", "lead_zh": "一加推出了 Ace 7 Pro，这款手机延续了 Ace 系列的游戏定位，但终于补上了相机这块短板。满血旗舰芯片和 3.5 倍潜望长焦是最大的两处升级。", "preview": "The standard Ace 7 already offers an active cooling fan, a 185Hz display and a 9000mAh battery, so the Pro model needed more to justify its ", "preview_zh": "标准版 Ace 7 已经配备了主动散热风扇、185Hz 屏幕和 9000mAh 电池，所以 Pro 版必须拿出更多东西才对得起这个名字。一加给出了两个答案。第一个是满血版第五代骁龙 8 至尊版芯片，采用 3nm 工艺，最高主频达到 4.6GHz。这让散热系统有了更大的发挥空间。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 946, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/97/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 96.275, "size_bytes": 578592, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 281, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/97/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 98.775, "size_bytes": 593568, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 281, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/97/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/97/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 105.225, "size_bytes": 632304, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 281, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/97/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/97/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 90.625, "size_bytes": 544752, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 281, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/97/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/97/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 97.25, "size_bytes": 584496, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 281, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/97/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@b7c82c2/content/data/versions/964.json", "paragraphs": ["The standard Ace 7 already offers an active cooling fan, a 185Hz display and a 9000mAh battery, so the Pro model needed more to justify its name. OnePlus answered with two changes. The first is a full version of the fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite chip, built on a 3nm process and reaching a top clock speed of 4.6GHz. This gives the cooling system more room to work.", "The second change concerns photography. Alongside the same 200-megapixel main camera as the standard model, the Ace 7 Pro adds a 50-megapixel 3.5x periscope telephoto lens. It is the first time the Ace series has included one, and it replaces the 8-megapixel ultra-wide camera found on the cheaper model. For a line once built mainly for gamers, this widens the phone's everyday appeal.", "The design stays fairly restrained. Our test unit came in Midnight Black, which uses a matte glass-fibre back and a metal frame instead of the patterned Windstorm finish. A new camera island called Storm Island hides the fan's air intake, and a small breathing light below it adds a touch of gaming character.", "Other features carry over from the standard model, including the 185Hz fourth-generation display, the 9000mAh battery and 100W fast charging. OnePlus says the battery lasts more than 15 hours in real use and refills fully in 49 minutes. The company is clearly aiming to keep the Ace 7 Pro strong at gaming while making it a more complete daily phone."], "paragraphs_zh": ["标准版 Ace 7 已经配备了主动散热风扇、185Hz 屏幕和 9000mAh 电池，所以 Pro 版必须拿出更多东西才对得起这个名字。一加给出了两个答案。第一个是满血版第五代骁龙 8 至尊版芯片，采用 3nm 工艺，最高主频达到 4.6GHz。这让散热系统有了更大的发挥空间。", "第二处变化在影像。除了与标准版相同的 2 亿像素主摄，Ace 7 Pro 还加入了一颗 5000 万像素的 3.5 倍潜望长焦镜头。这是 Ace 系列首次用上潜望长焦，也取代了便宜版本上的 800 万像素超广角。对一个曾经主要为游戏玩家打造的系列来说，这拓宽了手机的日常用途。", "外观设计比较克制。我们拿到的测试机是极夜黑，采用磨砂玻纤背板和金属中框，而不是带纹理的风暴配色。新的相机区域叫“风暴岛”，把风扇进风口藏了进去，下方的小呼吸灯则增添了一点电竞气质。", "其他配置延续自标准版，包括 185Hz 第四代屏幕、9000mAh 电池和 100W 快充。一加称这块电池实际使用可超过 15 小时，49 分钟即可充满。显然，一加希望 Ace 7 Pro 在保持游戏强项的同时，成为一台更全面的日常手机。"], "body": "The standard Ace 7 already offers an active cooling fan, a 185Hz display and a 9000mAh battery, so the Pro model needed more to justify its name. OnePlus answered with two changes. The first is a full version of the fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite chip, built on a 3nm process and reaching a top clock speed of 4.6GHz. This gives the cooling system more room to work.\n\nThe second change concerns photography. Alongside the same 200-megapixel main camera as the standard model, the Ace 7 Pro adds a 50-megapixel 3.5x periscope telephoto lens. It is the first time the Ace series has included one, and it replaces the 8-megapixel ultra-wide camera found on the cheaper model. For a line once built mainly for gamers, this widens the phone's everyday appeal.\n\nThe design stays fairly restrained. Our test unit came in Midnight Black, which uses a matte glass-fibre back and a metal frame instead of the patterned Windstorm finish. A new camera island called Storm Island hides the fan's air intake, and a small breathing light below it adds a touch of gaming character.\n\nOther features carry over from the standard model, including the 185Hz fourth-generation display, the 9000mAh battery and 100W fast charging. OnePlus says the battery lasts more than 15 hours in real use and refills fully in 49 minutes. The company is clearly aiming to keep the Ace 7 Pro strong at gaming while making it a more complete daily phone.", "body_zh": "标准版 Ace 7 已经配备了主动散热风扇、185Hz 屏幕和 9000mAh 电池，所以 Pro 版必须拿出更多东西才对得起这个名字。一加给出了两个答案。第一个是满血版第五代骁龙 8 至尊版芯片，采用 3nm 工艺，最高主频达到 4.6GHz。这让散热系统有了更大的发挥空间。\n\n第二处变化在影像。除了与标准版相同的 2 亿像素主摄，Ace 7 Pro 还加入了一颗 5000 万像素的 3.5 倍潜望长焦镜头。这是 Ace 系列首次用上潜望长焦，也取代了便宜版本上的 800 万像素超广角。对一个曾经主要为游戏玩家打造的系列来说，这拓宽了手机的日常用途。\n\n外观设计比较克制。我们拿到的测试机是极夜黑，采用磨砂玻纤背板和金属中框，而不是带纹理的风暴配色。新的相机区域叫“风暴岛”，把风扇进风口藏了进去，下方的小呼吸灯则增添了一点电竞气质。\n\n其他配置延续自标准版，包括 185Hz 第四代屏幕、9000mAh 电池和 100W 快充。一加称这块电池实际使用可超过 15 小时，49 分钟即可充满。显然，一加希望 Ace 7 Pro 在保持游戏强项的同时，成为一台更全面的日常手机。", "text": "The standard Ace 7 already offers an active cooling fan, a 185Hz display and a 9000mAh battery, so the Pro model needed more to justify its name. OnePlus answered with two changes. The first is a full version of the fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite chip, built on a 3nm process and reaching a top clock speed of 4.6GHz. This gives the cooling system more room to work. The second change concerns photography. Alongside the same 200-megapixel main camera as the standard model, the Ace 7 Pro adds a 50-megapixel 3.5x periscope telephoto lens. It is the first time the Ace series has included one, and it replaces the 8-megapixel ultra-wide camera found on the cheaper model. For a line once built mainly for gamers, this widens the phone's everyday appeal. The design stays fairly restrained. Our test unit came in Midnight Black, which uses a matte glass-fibre back and a metal frame instead of the patterned Windstorm finish. A new camera island called Storm Island hides the fan's air intake, and a small breathing light below it adds a touch of gaming character. Other features carry over from the standard model, including the 185Hz fourth-generation display, the 9000mAh battery and 100W fast charging. OnePlus says the battery lasts more than 15 hours in real use and refills fully in 49 minutes. The company is clearly aiming to keep the Ace 7 Pro strong at gaming while making it a more complete daily phone.", "vocab": [{"word": "justify", "pos": "verb", "zh": "证明……合理", "note": "常用 justify its name / the price", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "flagship", "pos": "noun", "zh": "旗舰产品", "note": "也可作形容词：flagship chip", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "periscope", "pos": "noun", "zh": "潜望式（镜头）", "note": "手机摄影术语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "telephoto", "pos": "adj", "zh": "长焦的", "note": "telephoto lens 长焦镜头", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "ultra-wide", "pos": "adj", "zh": "超广角的", "note": "相机镜头类型", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "restrained", "pos": "adj", "zh": "克制的、低调的", "note": "形容设计不张扬", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "matte", "pos": "adj", "zh": "磨砂的", "note": "matte finish 磨砂质感", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "intake", "pos": "noun", "zh": "进气口", "note": "air intake 进风口", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "carry over", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "沿用、保留", "note": "常指功能从旧款延续", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "refill", "pos": "verb", "zh": "重新充满", "note": "此处指充电", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "appeal", "pos": "noun", "zh": "吸引力", "note": "everyday appeal 日常吸引力", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "restrained", "pos": "adj", "zh": "克制的", "note": "重复项占位，替换为 below", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-14T01:33:28.391504", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.35, "sm": 275, "em": 349, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "standard", "s": 0.35, "e": 0.725, "sm": 350, "em": 725, "cs": 4, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "Ace", "s": 0.725, "e": 0.95, "sm": 725, "em": 950, "cs": 13, "ce": 16, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "7", "s": 0.95, "e": 1.3, "sm": 950, "em": 1299, "cs": 17, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "already", "s": 1.3, "e": 1.675, "sm": 1300, "em": 1675, "cs": 19, "ce": 26, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "offers", "s": 1.675, "e": 2.013, "sm": 1675, "em": 2012, "cs": 27, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "an", "s": 2.013, "e": 2.138, "sm": 2012, "em": 2137, "cs": 34, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "active", "s": 2.138, "e": 2.525, "sm": 2137, "em": 2524, "cs": 37, "ce": 43, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "cooling", "s": 2.525, "e": 2.925, "sm": 2525, "em": 2924, "cs": 44, "ce": 51, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "fan", "s": 2.925, "e": 3.475, "sm": 2925, "em": 3474, "cs": 52, "ce": 55, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": ",", "s": 3.475, "e": 3.587, "sm": 3475, "em": 3587, "cs": 55, "ce": 56, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "a", "s": 3.587, "e": 3.712, "sm": 3587, "em": 3712, "cs": 57, "ce": 58, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "185", "s": 3.712, "e": 4.665, "sm": 3712, "em": 4665, "cs": 59, "ce": 62, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "Hz", "s": 4.665, "e": 5.3, "sm": 4665, "em": 5300, "cs": 62, "ce": 64, "si": 0}, {"i": 14, "w": "display", "s": 5.3, "e": 5.837, "sm": 5300, "em": 5837, "cs": 65, "ce": 72, "si": 0}, {"i": 15, "w": "and", "s": 5.838, "e": 5.963, "sm": 5837, "em": 5962, "cs": 73, "ce": 76, "si": 0}, {"i": 16, "w": "a", "s": 5.963, "e": 6.062, "sm": 5962, "em": 6062, "cs": 77, "ce": 78, "si": 0}, {"i": 17, "w": "9000", "s": 6.062, "e": 6.698, "sm": 6062, "em": 6698, "cs": 79, "ce": 83, "si": 0}, {"i": 18, "w": "mAh", "s": 6.698, "e": 7.175, "sm": 6698, "em": 7174, "cs": 83, "ce":